{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"eee666c8493fe532d5446c3aaf2fed28222ae55e8337e715e1f3d496aead4ed4"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:3b51a737625d3332ba139636fa2d8ade0d9a49ac30385e1260fd8c674e06c2ff","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Italy and France.","evidence":"[D13:24 | 3:18 pm on 4 May, 2023] Maria: Last year I took a solo trip and took this pic in Spain. It reminded me that life is hard but there's still hope and beauty. It made me realize the importance of relying on my inner strength and appreciating small moments even more.\n[D8:15 | 6:03 pm on 6 March, 2023] Maria: Thanks, John! I got the idea from that trip to England a few years ago - I was mesmerized by the castles. I wanted to bring that same magic to my home, like a reminder of the world's beauty. I made a painting too!","itemId":"urn:uuid:c276e373-a8fa-53d3-b24a-02f5e50fa4e5","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:994a2a0e0aa9f95ab5cc19cb7388549302df9a75c7eba25b43b4e78e40a5688e","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What European countries has Maria been to?","referenceAnswer":"Spain, England","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"994a2a0e0aa9f95ab5cc19cb7388549302df9a75c7eba25b43b4e78e40a5688e"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}